{% decision_card number="ADR-0013" status="approved" %}
One decision. Status reviewed 2026-07-27.
{% /decision_card %}

## Context

Chat memory and runtime state are incomplete and provider-specific.

## Decision drivers

- Version history
- Reviewability
- Cross-agent continuity
- Retrieval

## Options considered

- Chat transcripts
- Runtime database as truth
- Version-controlled Markdoc

## Decision

Store approved business, architecture, decisions, contracts, workflows, and runbooks in Markdoc. Propose all updates through repository review.

## Positive consequences

- Durable provider-neutral memory
- Lower repeated context

## Negative consequences

- Requires maintenance discipline

## Risks

- Stale approved pages can misroute work

## Follow-up work

- Track owner and review date
- Run conflict and link validation

## Supersedes or superseded by

Extends ADR-0004 and ADR-0006; superseded by: none.

